{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act35side_level_act35side_02_beg",
  "groupId": "act35side",
  "stageId": "act35side_02",
  "title": "馆中特别行动",
  "storyCode": "AS-2",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act35side/level_act35side_02_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "161beed3a28e9d70aaf746df5f85abc2725b5432730721d76715251e278e936d",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g8_sargondeluxeroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真是精细啊，刚刚没注意到，这个家伙居然连表情与口型都能够模仿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "张开嘴让我看看，啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（张嘴）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咽喉处很明显有类似声带的发声装置，那为何到现在你都一言不发？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奇怪，按理说，发声也是声带与肌肉的动作，你应该能够模仿才是啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佩佩靠近尸体，把手搭上它的喉咙，而尸体则依着她的样子，将手按在佩佩的喉咙上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......知......道......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......滋......得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "迅速抽回手，佩佩不可思议地捂住嘴巴，眼中透出惊喜的光彩。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "真的能说话啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太神奇了......想不到沙阿那个年代真有如此精巧的工匠技艺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先祖曾在一本《古历纪工艺考证》中提及......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有异人可用源石回路宝石封存人的意识，然后用黄金为其重塑躯壳，可供人行动千年而不腐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "长生军......失传的技艺......陛下会对你很有兴趣的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宝库肯定藏在你记忆的深处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可不能仅仅是学我说话，你还得告诉我它到底在哪里。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "让我看看......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“第一颗代表心脏，自它跳动，我们便存在。第二颗代表肺，当我们初次呼吸，记忆便开始。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“第三颗代表胃肠，食物进入肚皮，舌头变得挑剔，我们有了喜好、个性。第四颗代表肝脏，我们清醒着进入夜晚，为了职责与义务。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第五颗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第五颗是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有，诗歌到这里就断了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来那位阿尔萨兰的前代研究者也没有答案。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你一定能帮我找到答案，对吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "女孩再次伸出手，将手指按在尸体的喉咙处。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，女士。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗨，学人精。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗨，学人精。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "缓缓抽回手，女孩又握住尸体的手，用尽力气攥紧，而尸体也回握住她。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "无名古尸",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1479_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佩佩",
      "speakerId": "avg_4058_pepe_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就当你答应了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g5_museum"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿雅吉，我已经到了，为什么我没在门前看到你？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你现在在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（小声）你说你不知道你现在在哪里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有通行证我要怎么进去......该死，这里的馆长把办公室搞得像保险柜一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，来不及了，这会儿人都快疏散干净了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉我......阿雅吉，走廊上的窗户和馆长办公室的窗是相邻的吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是，我知道很高。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "娜仁图亚",
      "speakerId": "avg_4138_narant_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我会小心的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "48_g7_galleriesstaircase"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第一，博物馆内禁止喧哗。第二，无序乃是理性的大敌。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要推搡，这里陈列的雕像与大型壁画没有展柜保护，很容易——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就像我刚刚说的一样，这尊雕像差点就摔碎了，这很不好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "历史虽然已经过去，但绝不是与我们无关，可能我们摔碎的，是五百年前的人们征服山峰的欢呼，或他们高举葡萄酒杯的笑声。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，您解说得真好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......但您确定要一直扛着这个雕像吗？还有您手里的其他东西？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我要把它们带回它们该在的地方。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都要闭馆了，您真敬业。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......闭馆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，广播突然说有什么紧急事件，吓死人了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个带我们离开的糊涂蛋员工一路上左右不分，嘴上说左转，结果把我们往右边引，左拐的时候，她又喊着接下来往右边走。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一点我认同，女士，我也对这座博物馆在某些方面的处置略有不满。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个员工莫名其妙把我们带到这个鬼地方来，自己又跑得无影无踪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这一点我不认同，女士，容我申辩，这里并不是鬼地方，而是米诺——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不知道，发现迷路的时候，我们都吓坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是没来得及离场，被关在博物馆里面，肯定只能见到凶神恶煞的亡魂啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看那将领的盔甲，看那活祭的祭坛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对......！这就是为什么我一直不敢来博物馆......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "游客的后脑勺即将撞到地板的一瞬间，阿斯帕齐娅拉住了他。\n雕像、陶罐与金杯都被临时放下，与伊比利亚人开拓玻利瓦尔商道所用的火炮并排。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宝贝！你怎么了？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......应该是受到过度惊吓导致的晕厥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我这里有嗅盐，能够救急，但出去之后需要及时去医院检查。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯帕齐娅熟练地压碎裹在棉花中的薄玻璃管，将湿润的棉球凑近游客的鼻子。\n随后，她扛起苏醒的游客，平静地走到队伍最前面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发生了紧急事件，是吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐......你的胳膊好有力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大家跟好我，出了事情，我会保护好你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "虚弱的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "姐姐......好棒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g5_museum"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，小家伙，以后不要乱跑了好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我有印象，你是拉恕尔养的宠物——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——哎哟，你怎么挠我！我可刚从人潮里把你解救出来，让我抱一会儿不好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的毛可真软，拉恕尔到底是怎么把你搞到手的？我之前也想要一只这么特别的，但他死活不肯告诉我你是什么品种，去哪儿能买到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一开始还不明白自己为什么这么喜欢你，最近才恍然大悟，你长得特别像暗阑时代的云兽雕像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，现在工作人员都安排好了，游客在有序撤离，既然不能让你乱窜，我带你去我的工作室看看正在修复的那尊雕像吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g13_smallroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "越过层层向下的阶梯，梅捷缇克缇来到了用于文物修复的房间。\n为了减少对文物的影响，空调温度很低，空气又冷又干。巨大的房间内只有一盏白炽灯照明，她吐了一口气，发现竟然能够凝成白气。\n平时协助修复的员工都被派去维持馆内秩序了，地下层一片死寂。抽抽鼻子，她觉得心跳得有些快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要怕，小家伙，我的工作台就在这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "桌台上还残留着一些类似树脂的金色物质，那是缇缇使用源石技艺辅助修复文物的痕迹。\n但原本放在桌上的云兽雕像却不见踪影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g6_museum_core"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乱转的员工",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1484_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我没看到云兽......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g1_menatmainstreet_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "异乡的游客",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1486_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚刚，在你的额头有一片阴影掠过，这不是什么好征兆，它预示着你会遭遇厄运。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g13_smallroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......你到底是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你难道也复活了？和那具古尸一样？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊啊！我辛辛苦苦把你修好，不是为了让你和阿娜特的研究对象一样乱跑！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更不是为了给自己招来厄运！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库保管员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "发生什么了？！！谁在尖叫！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库保管员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦......梅捷缇克缇女士，您、您怎么在这里？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "仓库保管员",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我刚刚接到要暂时闭馆的通知，以为您短时间里不会回来了，所以帮您把修复中的文物收起来了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "梅捷缇克缇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1478_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......没什么，我今天想加班了，你先走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g4_ctizengarden"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆保安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？从东南展厅疏散的那一批游客还没找到？不是说让吉雅阿带出来了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆保安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我得关门了！是副馆长亲自发布的紧急闭馆指令，我都不敢想事情有多糟糕！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆售票员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有人去里面找过了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆保安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经派人去了，但都说找不到，吉雅阿到底把人带去哪里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆保安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆售票员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎么突然不说话了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆保安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆售票员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆保安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是风的声音。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阳光下，一列队伍缓缓走出了大门。\n为首的女人神色专注宁静，几十人的队伍井然有序，跟随在她后面。\n风带起她的衣角，吹乱她的发丝，她毫无动摇地扛着肩上虚弱的游客，犹如一尊屹立多年的雕像被赋予生命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆保安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我总觉得这个场景在哪里见过......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆售票员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1491_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我明白，我看过那尊雕像很多次。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆保安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有这样姿势的雕像？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "博物馆保安",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_020",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，谢天谢地，终于可以关门了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷路的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太感谢了，这是我的名片，您如果有空照顾我们家族的宝石生意，我一定为您提供最高等级贵宾服务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "热情的游客",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，你到时候来炎国玩啊！阿姨家里还有个大小伙子，长得可好看了。我姐家还有个单身的大姑娘，刚去天师府上班，你也可以见见。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢各位，不必......我只是做了我该做的事情......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "阿斯帕齐娅猛地回过头。\n卷帘门缓缓放下，安保人员正将“今日闭馆”的牌子拖到大门前面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿斯帕齐娅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1477_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我的金杯呢？我的陶罐呢？我的雕像呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "53_g10_grandbazaar_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风姿绰约的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1258_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "娜娜到底跑哪里去了？都这个时候了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风姿绰约的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1258_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "石榴石浆果店里没有，琉璃珐琅瓷器店里没有，就连她最爱钻的天青石贴面水管里也没有......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啧，找了这么久，简直是浪费时间。我看，那只云兽就是被博物馆暴走的古尸吃掉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风姿绰约的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1258_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "讨厌，怎么会！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "宠物，宠一时就得了，好东西多的是，你想要什么，我都买给你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要你点头，别说那些名贵宝石了，就连整个宝石交易所，我也能买下来送给你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的动物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1483_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（抬起头）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风姿绰约的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1258_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？你这是默许了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风姿绰约的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1258_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你看你脚边......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的动物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1483_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（瞪）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么是拉恕尔养的崽子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，装什么威风？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "冷傲的市民",
      "speakerId": "avg_4140_lasher_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......咳咳，你在啊，拉恕尔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "正好，我们做个买卖吧，我的姑娘对这间宝石交易所很感兴趣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "风姿绰约的女人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1258_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别闹了，我可没这么说......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在萨尔贡东部有一座移动平台，建有规模庞大的源石精炼厂、染料厂、粮食加工厂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "把所有这些都加起来，再附赠些金银财宝，够买下这间宝石交易所了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4140_lasher_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我拒绝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4140_lasher_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你承担不起这间宝石交易所的重量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，重量......小伙子，你倒是继承了你外祖父的高傲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听我一句劝吧，要么像他一样，养几头凶恶的裂兽来镇场子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要么让你的小云兽来迎接像我这样的贵客，至少它还会卖卖乖......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_804_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶——好痛！你这畜生，你咬我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的动物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1483_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（呲牙）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的动物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1483_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "汪——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "穿金戴玉的男人",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，滚开啊，别追——别追上来啊——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "神秘的动物",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1483_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "汪汪汪——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4140_lasher_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......沃奥，别生气了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4140_lasher_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不怀敬意的人已经跑远了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1483_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "汪嗷！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4140_lasher_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？想要让我摸摸？......这里吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "沃奥",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_1483_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（开心地舔舔）"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "一只羽兽飞来，停落在年轻的宝石交易所监管人的肩头。\n监管人拨弄了金属羽兽身上的几处机关，随后上紧发条，将羽兽重新放飞。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4140_lasher_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......他越来越活跃了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4140_lasher_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们想必也很期待和他见面吧？米奥很少这么积极地外出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4140_lasher_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚才那人说要让小云兽来迎接重要的客人，或许也有道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "拉恕尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_4140_lasher_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......米奥真的能把他吸引过来吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
